  "description": "CarbonPlan's virtual DataTree over the full NEX-GDDP-CMIP6 v2.0 archive on AWS Open Data: 38 TB of NetCDF in about 740 MB of Icechunk v2, plus a 'basal' catalog store. Fully anonymous. The store is a DataTree, so open it with xr.open_datatree on the Icechunk session store rather than xr.open_zarr. Source data are CC0; the store itself carries no license. CarbonPlan also published 164 Kerchunk Parquet reference sets for the same data in 2024 at s3://carbonplan-share/nasa-nex-reference/references_prod/ (not catalogued here).\n\nStatus (probed 2026-11-06): Published 2026-07-29.",
